.vercel
node_modules

# Google Drive copies. When Drive loses a race with the editor it empties the
# real file and parks the content in a numbered twin. The number is not always
# 2: "package-lock 4.json" and ".vercelignore 2" are both here today, and the
# second has no extension after the number, so it takes two patterns.
# Never delete the twins by hand, Drive reconciles them in minutes, but they
# must never be committed either.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
